<title>USA: AnnTaylor Stores Jan same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor Stores Jan same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$43.4	$41.0	+5.9	 +2.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $798.1     $721.5     +10.6	 +1.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Full company name is    AnnTaylor Stores Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: Month sales are for 4 wks ended Feb 1, 1997, vs 4 wks ended Jan 27, 1996, excluding fifth wk of fiscal Jan 1996. Comparable store sales are for 4 wks ended Feb 1, 1997, vs same 4 wks last year. Year-to-date sales are for 52 wks ended Feb 1, 1997 vs 52 wks ended Jan 27, 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
